/Title (The\040discrete\040geodesic\040problem)
/Author (Joseph\040S\056\040B\056\040Mitchell\054\040David\040M\056\040Mount\054\040Christos\040H\056\040Papadimitriou)
/Subject (We\040present\040an\040algorithm\040for\040determining\040the\040shortest\040path\040between\040a\040source\040and\040a\040destination\040on\040an\040arbitrary\040\050possibly\040nonconvex\051\040polyhedral\040surface\056\040The\040path\040is\040constrained\040to\040lie\040on\040the\040surface\054\040and\040distances\040are\040measured\040according\040to\040the\040Euclidean\040metric\056\040Our\040algorithm\040runs\040in\040time\040O\050n\040log\040n\051\040and\040requires\040O\050n2\051\040space\054\040where\040n\040is\040the\040number\040ofedges\040ofthe\040surface\056\040Afterwe\040run\040our\040algorithm\054\040the\040distance\040from\040the\040source\040to\040any\040other\040destination\040may\040be\040determined\040using\040standard\040techniques\040in\040time\040O\050log\040n\051\040by\040locating\040the\040destination\040in\040the\040subdivision\040created\040by\040the\040algorithm\056\040The\040actual\040shortest\040path\040from\040the\040source\040to\040a\040destination\040can\040be\040reported\040in\040time\040O\050k\053\040log\040n\051\054\040where\040k\040is\040the\040number\040of\040faces\040crossed\040by\040the\040path\056\040The\040algorithm\040generalizes\040to\040the\040case\040of\040multiple\040source\040points\040to\040build\040the\040Voronoi\040diagram\040on\040the\040surface\054\040where\040n\040is\040now\040the\040maximum\040of\040the\040number\040of\040vertices\040and\040the\040number\040of\040sources\056)
